                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "3. Bank Implementation and Duration",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                507,
                366,
                526
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    507.0
                ],
                [
                    365.0,
                    507.0
                ],
                [
                    365.0,
                    525.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    525.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The Bank shall have two enrollment periods yearly (the first thirty (30) calendar days of the first and second semesters).",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                526,
                522,
                561
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    526.0
                ],
                [
                    522.0,
                    526.0
                ],
                [
                    522.0,
                    561.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    561.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. A member enrolling during a specific enrollment period may begin receiving benefits from the Bank commencing with the first duty day following the close of the enrollment period. Benefits shall be retroactive during that enrollment if the enrollee meets all other eligibility requirements.",
            "block_bbox": [
                112,
                561,
                522,
                651
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    112.0,
                    561.0
                ],
                [
                    522.0,
                    561.0
                ],
                [
                    522.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    112.0,
                    651.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "4. Replenishment Contributions",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                651,
                322,
                669
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    321.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    321.0,
                    668.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    668.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Following the establishment of the Bank, all participating members shall contribute an additional sick leave day in order to continue membership if the balance of the Bank is diminished below three hundred (300) days, at which time each participating member shall be sent a notice. Participating members will have a twenty-one (21) calendar day time limit from receipt of the replenishment notification to withdraw from the Bank. Assessment will be automatic if the member does not return the signed enrollment/withdrawal form to the Personnel Department within the time limit.",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                669,
                524,
                846
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    669.0
                ],
                [
                    524.0,
                    669.0
                ],
                [
                    524.0,
                    846.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    846.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. If a member is unable to contribute the day, that member will be ineligible for the benefits of the Bank until he has accrued two (2) sick leave days, at which time the assessment of one (1) day will be automatic. This, however, will not apply to any member who is receiving benefits from the Bank.",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                845,
                524,
                933
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    115.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    524.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    524.0,
                    933.0
                ],
                [
                    115.0,
                    933.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. If the Bank cannot be replenished, it will be terminated when the total number of days has been exhausted.",
            "block_bbox": [
